---
layout: base.njk
title: Một chuyện thôi mẹ!
description: 'Truyện kể trước giờ ngủ, sách Cappu & Lucia của NXB Kim Đồng và một ngôi làng nhỏ May đang dựng — cho bé từ 2 đến 6 tuổi và bố mẹ.'
permalink: /mot-chuyen-thoi-me/
css: ke
bodyClass: p-ke
navKey: mot-chuyen-thoi-me
footNote: chúc bé ngủ ngon. chúc mẹ được ngủ.
footColor: "#A8522B"
---
{% from "macros.njk" import mform with context %}
{% set k = motChuyen %}
{% set star %}<path d="M12 2l2.9 6.3 6.9.7-5.2 4.6 1.5 6.8L12 17l-6.1 3.4 1.5-6.8L2.2 9l6.9-.7z"/>{% endset %}
{% set playIcon %}<div class="play"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#FBF6EE" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>{% endset %}
{% set thumbColors = ["#F3C6C0", "#C3DCE8", "#F2C14E", "#B5CDA5"] %}

<div class="sky">
  <div class="hide-s" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="mobile-bar"></div>
    <div class="hang" style="left: calc(6% + 22px); height: 210px"><svg style="position: absolute; bottom: -26px; left: -25px" width="52" height="52" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F2C14E" stroke="#C1653A" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round">{{ star | safe }}</svg></div>
    <div class="hang b" style="left: calc(6% + 100px); height: 140px"><svg style="position: absolute; bottom: -38px; left: -27px" width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56"><path d="M40 12 a20 20 0 1 0 6 26 a16 16 0 1 1 -6 -26 z" fill="#F3C6C0" stroke="#C1653A" stroke-width="2"/></svg></div>
    <div class="hang c" style="left: calc(6% + 180px); height: 250px"><svg style="position: absolute; bottom: -22px; left: -21px" width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#C3DCE8" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round">{{ star | safe }}</svg></div>
    <div class="hang" style="left: calc(6% + 270px); height: 170px"><svg style="position: absolute; bottom: -34px; left: -30px" width="62" height="40" viewBox="0 0 62 40"><path d="M14 34 a12 12 0 0 1 2 -22 a16 16 0 0 1 28 -2 a12 12 0 0 1 6 24 z" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#C1653A" stroke-width="2"/></svg></div>
  </div>

  <svg class="moon" width="200" height="200" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M128 40 a70 70 0 1 0 30 112 a56 56 0 1 1 -30 -112 z" fill="#F2C14E" stroke="#C1653A" stroke-width="3"/>
    <path d="M66 98 q8 7 16 0" fill="none" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <circle cx="62" cy="114" r="7" fill="#F3C6C0"/>
    <path d="M70 128 q8 6 14 0" fill="none" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M78 52 L132 40 Q116 8 76 18 Z" fill="#6E2A34"/>
    <circle cx="76" cy="18" r="9" fill="#FBF6EE"/>
    <text x="150" y="60" font-family="Patrick Hand, cursive" font-size="26" fill="#6E2A34" class="z">z</text>
    <text x="160" y="50" font-family="Patrick Hand, cursive" font-size="20" fill="#6E2A34" class="z b">z</text>
    <text x="168" y="42" font-family="Patrick Hand, cursive" font-size="16" fill="#6E2A34" class="z c">z</text>
  </svg>

  <svg class="stars" viewBox="0 0 1440 640" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <g fill="#F2C14E" stroke="#C1653A" stroke-width="1.2">
      <path class="tw" d="M520 120 l5 13 13 5 -13 5 -5 13 -5 -13 -13 -5 13 -5z"/>
      <path class="tw b" d="M930 80 l4 10 10 4 -10 4 -4 10 -4 -10 -10 -4 10 -4z"/>
      <path class="tw c" d="M1080 300 l5 12 12 5 -12 5 -5 12 -5 -12 -12 -5 12 -5z"/>
      <path class="tw b" d="M300 420 l4 10 10 4 -10 4 -4 10 -4 -10 -10 -4 10 -4z"/>
      <path class="tw" d="M1300 480 l4 10 10 4 -10 4 -4 10 -4 -10 -10 -4 10 -4z"/>
      <path class="tw c" d="M700 40 l3 8 8 3 -8 3 -3 8 -3 -8 -8 -3 8 -3z"/>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <div class="wrap" style="position: relative">
    {% include "nav.njk" %}
    <header class="head" id="noi-dung">
      <div class="serif sub-line">dưới gốc đa</div>
      <h1 class="script h1">Một chuyện thôi mẹ!</h1>
      <div class="hand" style="font-size: 23px; color: #A8522B; margin-bottom: 24px">(thêm một truyện nữa thôi...)</div>
      <p style="font-size: 19px; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto">{{ k.loiMoDau }}</p>
    </header>
  </div>

  <svg style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 90px" viewBox="0 0 1440 90" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 60 C 80 20, 160 20, 220 50 C 280 10, 400 10, 450 55 C 520 20, 620 25, 660 58 C 740 15, 860 20, 900 56 C 980 18, 1080 22, 1120 55 C 1190 15, 1320 20, 1360 52 C 1400 35, 1430 40, 1440 45 V90 H0 Z" fill="#FBF6EE"/></svg>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="g3" style="margin: 30px 0 110px">
    <a class="door" href="#nghe-ke" style="background: #F2C14E">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 15v-3a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v3"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="5" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="16" y="14" width="5" height="7" rx="2"/></svg>
      <span class="serif" style="font-size: 26px; color: #6E2A34; font-weight: 600">Truyện kể trên YouTube</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Mở truyện, tắt đèn, nằm nghe cùng con.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="door" href="#sach" style="background: #C3DCE8">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6v18H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M21 5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-6v18h6a2 2 0 0 0 2-2z"/></svg>
      <span class="serif" style="font-size: 26px; color: #6E2A34; font-weight: 600">Sách Cappu &amp; Lucia</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Ba câu chuyện về ba nỗi sợ của trẻ nhỏ, cùng {{ k.sach.nxb }}.</span>
    </a>
    <a class="door" href="#ngoi-lang" style="background: #B5CDA5">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7"/><path d="M5 10v10h14V10"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg>
      <span class="serif" style="font-size: 26px; color: #6E2A34; font-weight: 600">Một ngôi làng nhỏ</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Mười con mèo màu lạ đang chờ tên.</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <section id="nghe-ke" style="margin-bottom: 120px">
    <div class="sec-top">
      <div>
        <h2 class="serif" style="font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0; color: #6E2A34; font-weight: 500">Tắt đèn. <span style="font-style: italic">Bật truyện.</span></h2>
      </div>
      {% if site.social.youtube %}<a class="btn3d" href="{{ site.social.youtube }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">Mở kênh YouTube</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if k.videos.length %}
    <div class="g3">
      {% for v in k.videos %}
      <a class="vid" href="{{ v.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="thumb" style="background: {{ thumbColors[loop.index0 % 4] }}">{% if v.anh %}<img src="{{ v.anh }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{{ playIcon | safe }}</div>
        <div class="kick" style="margin-top: 14px">Tập {{ loop.index }}{% if v.ghiChu %} · {{ v.ghiChu }}{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="serif" style="font-size: 20px; color: #6E2A34">{{ v.ten }}</div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="soon-box">
      <div class="thumb" style="background: #F3C6C0; width: 200px; flex-shrink: 0"><svg style="position: absolute; top: 14px; right: 18px" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F2C14E" aria-hidden="true">{{ star | safe }}</svg>{{ playIcon | safe }}</div>
      <div>
        <div class="kick">Tập 01 · sắp lên sóng</div>
        <p style="margin: 6px 0 0">May đang chuẩn bị những câu chuyện đầu tiên. Để lại email <a href="#bao-tin">ở cuối trang</a>, tập đầu có là May báo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</div>

<section id="sach" class="shelf">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-top" style="margin-bottom: 40px">
      <div>
        <div class="kick" style="margin-bottom: 10px">{{ k.sach.tenBo }} · {{ k.sach.nxb }}</div>
        <h2 class="serif" style="font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #6E2A34; font-weight: 500">Cappu &amp; Lucia {% if k.sach.trangThai %}<span class="stamp">{{ k.sach.trangThai }}</span>{% endif %}</h2>
        <div style="font-size: 15px">{{ k.sach.tacGia }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 22px">
        {% if k.sach.sapCo %}<div class="hand" style="font-size: 21px; color: #6E2A34; max-width: 220px; transform: rotate(-2deg)">{{ k.sach.sapCo }}</div>{% endif %}
        <figure class="hide-s mini-pol" style="transform: rotate(4deg); width: 200px"><img src="/assets/images/gio-doc-sach.jpg" alt="Mẹ đọc sách cho con" loading="lazy" style="height: 220px"><figcaption class="hand" style="font-size: 17px; margin-top: 8px">giờ đọc sách nhà mình</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="g3">
      {% for b in k.sach.cuon %}
      <div class="book">
        <div class="cover"><img src="{{ b.bia }}" alt="Bìa sách {{ b.ten }}" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div><h3 class="serif" style="font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.35; color: #6E2A34; font-weight: 600; margin: 0">{{ b.ten }}</h3><div class="hand" style="font-size: 19px; color: #6E2A34">{{ b.noiSo }}</div></div>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px">{{ b.moTa }}</p>
        {% if b.linkMua %}<a class="buy" href="{{ b.linkMua }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mua sách</a>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if k.sach.ghiChu %}
    <div class="shelf-note">
      <div class="hand" style="font-size: 20px; color: #6E2A34">{{ k.sach.ghiChu }}</div>
      <a class="btn3d" href="#bao-tin">Báo mình khi sách về</a>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="ngoi-lang" class="village">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="g2 village-grid">
      <div>
        <h2 class="serif village-h">{{ k.ngoiLang.tieuDe | mdInline | safe }}</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 16px">{{ k.ngoiLang.moTa }}</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap">
          <figure class="mini-pol" style="transform: rotate(-3deg); width: 170px"><img src="/assets/images/meo-trong-hop.jpg" alt="Mèo con trong hộp giấy" loading="lazy" style="height: 150px"></figure>
          <figure class="mini-pol" style="transform: rotate(3deg); width: 170px"><img src="/assets/images/meo-trang-trong-rung.jpg" alt="Mèo trắng trong rừng" loading="lazy" style="height: 150px"></figure>
          <div class="hand" style="font-size: 18px; color: #6E2A34; align-self: center; max-width: 160px">mèo ngoài đời. trước khi thành mèo trong truyện.</div>
        </div>
        <div id="bao-tin">{{ mform("em-ke", "Email của bố mẹ", "Báo khi có sách, truyện mới", "chung", "max-width: 500px") }}</div>
      </div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 560 400" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block" role="img" aria-label="Phác thảo ngôi làng ban ngày: mặt trời, ngọn đồi, hiệu sách, cây biết nói và mười con mèo nhiều màu">
        <circle cx="470" cy="70" r="38" fill="#F2C14E"/>
        <g stroke="#F2C14E" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M470 14v-10"/><path d="M470 136v10"/><path d="M414 70h-10"/><path d="M526 70h10"/><path d="M430 30l-7-7"/><path d="M510 110l7 7"/><path d="M510 30l7-7"/><path d="M430 110l-7 7"/></g>
        <path d="M60 80 a16 16 0 0 1 22 -14 a20 20 0 0 1 36 4 a14 14 0 0 1 2 26 h-54 a12 12 0 0 1 -6 -16 z" fill="#FBF6EE"/>
        <path d="M0 290 C 120 210, 240 220, 330 260 S 500 240, 560 200 V400 H0 Z" fill="#B5CDA5"/>
        <path d="M0 330 C 140 290, 280 300, 400 330 S 520 330, 560 320 V400 H0 Z" fill="#8FB07F"/>
        <rect x="400" y="168" width="70" height="56" fill="#FBF6EE" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M390 172 L435 134 L480 172 Z" fill="#C1653A" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><rect x="426" y="194" width="18" height="30" fill="#6E2A34"/><rect x="408" y="182" width="12" height="12" fill="#C3DCE8" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <path d="M160 296 V236" stroke="#8A5A3C" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M100 236 a40 40 0 0 1 24 -62 a48 48 0 0 1 80 -6 a40 40 0 0 1 36 56 a30 30 0 0 1 -20 18 z" fill="#8FB07F" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <path d="M146 204 q5 -5 10 0 M168 204 q5 -5 10 0" fill="none" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M152 218 q10 8 20 0" fill="none" stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="142" cy="214" r="5" fill="#F3C6C0"/><circle cx="182" cy="214" r="5" fill="#F3C6C0"/>
        <g stroke="#6E2A34" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path d="M40 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z M58 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z" fill="#F2C14E"/><circle cx="55" cy="368" r="13" fill="#F2C14E"/>
          <path d="M88 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z M103 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z" fill="#F3C6C0"/><circle cx="100" cy="366" r="11" fill="#F3C6C0"/>
          <path d="M130 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z M148 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z" fill="#C1653A"/><circle cx="145" cy="368" r="13" fill="#C1653A"/>
          <path d="M178 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z M193 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z" fill="#FBF6EE"/><circle cx="190" cy="366" r="11" fill="#FBF6EE"/>
          <path d="M220 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z M238 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z" fill="#9BBFD3"/><circle cx="235" cy="368" r="13" fill="#9BBFD3"/>
          <path d="M268 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z M283 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z" fill="#D9B8D8"/><circle cx="280" cy="366" r="11" fill="#D9B8D8"/>
          <path d="M310 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z M328 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z" fill="#E8955F"/><circle cx="325" cy="368" r="13" fill="#E8955F"/>
          <path d="M358 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z M373 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z" fill="#B5CDA5"/><circle cx="370" cy="366" r="11" fill="#B5CDA5"/>
          <path d="M400 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z M418 362 l6 -10 l6 10 z" fill="#6E2A34"/><circle cx="415" cy="368" r="13" fill="#6E2A34"/>
          <path d="M448 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z M463 360 l5 -9 l5 9 z" fill="#F7E08A"/><circle cx="460" cy="366" r="11" fill="#F7E08A"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div style="background: #8FB07F; height: 18px"></div>

<div class="wrap">{% include "foot.njk" %}</div>
